6-07-29"},"sources":[{"source_id":"casino:source:bcgame:trustee-final-report-2025-07-22","canonical_url":"https://nagelmakers.com/downloads/bankruptcies/250722-tweede-faillissementsverslag-SH-%28ZB%29.pdf","title":"Second and final public bankruptcy report — Small House B.V.","publisher":"Court-appointed trustee Barbara Nagelmakers","published_at":"2025-07-22","accessed_at":"2026-07-29","source_tier":"A","source_role":"independent","resolving":1,"evidence_reviewed":1,"evidence_reviewed_at":"2026-07-29","evidence_reviewer":"chaindump-research-desk","notes":"Court-supervised estate report identifies judgment CUR2024H00248, the November 12, 2024 bankruptcy order, BC.Game operation as the debtor''s activity, an unknown balance sheet, nil closing estate balance, and a final-report proposal to terminate the bankruptcy. It is not a complete asset map."},{"source_id":"casino:source:bcgame:cga-certificate-2026-07-29","canonical_url":"https://cert.cga.cw/certificate?id=ZXlKcGRpSTZJa2x1ZEdjMVFuUTFVRzF4VERWUWJYRXpXakZaU0VFOVBTSXNJblpoYkhWbElqb2llV3BKZFhsTlRtTkJXbkZoUWpGUE9IWnZha3hpUVQwOUlpd2liV0ZqSWpvaVltVTNNVEZtTjJRek1qVXhOemt6WldVeFpHWXlNVGxtTURVM1pqSTVNemd3WldGbFpUSmtZamszTWpGa01tSTJORFU0WWpNME9EYzRNMk0zTlRJd05DSXNJblJoWnlJNklpSjk%3D","title":"Small House B.V. OGL/2023/118/0060 certificate","publisher":"Curaçao Gaming Authority","published_at":null,"accessed_at":"2026-07-29","source_tier":"A","source_role":"independent","resolving":1,"evidence_reviewed":1,"evidence_reviewed_at":"2026-07-29","evidence_reviewer":"chaindump-research-desk","notes":"Current official certificate identifies Small House B.V., company 164979, licence OGL/2023/118/0060 and status Revoked. It scopes the Curaçao licence only."}],"claims":[{"claim_id":"casino:claim:bcgame:bankruptcy","field_path":"status.insolvent","source_id":"casino:source:bcgame:trustee-final-report-2025-07-22","evidence_locator":"Court-appointed trustee''s final report identifies judgment CUR2024H00248 and states that the Joint Court declared Small House B.V. bankrupt on November 12, 2024.","claim_type":"event","support_direction":"supports","analyst_note":"Applies only to the Small House B.V. estate; it does not classify the current international BC.Game brand.","checked_at":"2026-07-29"},{"claim_id":"casino:claim:bcgame:trustee-final-report","field_path":"status.insolvent,events.bankruptcy,observations.estate_balance","source_id":"casino:source:bcgame:trustee-final-report-2025-07-22","evidence_locator":"Final trustee report records the November 12, 2024 bankruptcy judgment, describes BC.Game operation as Small House''s activity, lists the balance sheet as unknown and the closing estate balance as nil, and proposes termination of the bankruptcy.","claim_type":"event","support_direction":"supports","analyst_note":"This is estate-level evidence. Nil estate balance is not converted into a claimant recovery percentage, and the report disclaims completeness.","checked_at":"2026-07-29"},{"claim_id":"casino:claim:bcgame:cga-current-revocation","field_path":"licences.curacao,status.licence","source_id":"casino:source:bcgame:cga-certificate-2026-07-29","evidence_locator":"CGA certificate identifies Small House B.V. and licence OGL/2023/118/0060 and displays current status Revoked.","claim_type":"licence","support_direction":"supports","analyst_note":"The certificate does not identify the current operator or licence of the international BC.Game brand.","checked_at":"2026-07-29"}],"event":{"event_id":"casino:event:bcgame:trustee-final-report:2025-07-22","event_type":"insolvency","event_date":"2025-07-22","date_precision":"day","description":"The court-appointed trustee issued a second and final public report for Small House B.V., reporting a nil estate balance and proposing termination of the bankruptcy.","source_claim_ids":["casino:claim:bcgame:trustee-final-report"]},"synthesis_patch":{"present_situation":"Small House B.V.''s scoped Curaçao estate remains a failed operator case. The trustee''s July 22, 2025 final report records the bankruptcy order, an unknown balance sheet, a nil closing estate balance and a proposal to terminate the proceeding; the CGA certificate reviewed July 29, 2026 still displays its licence as revoked. These records do not establish that the current international BC.Game brand has ceased.","risk_legal_posture":"Court-supervised trustee and current regulator records establish the scoped estate and revoked Curaçao licence. Claimant recovery, asset transfers and the present international operator remain unresolved; the operator''s contrary global-continuity statement remains preserved.","success_failure_hypotheses":"The observed sequence is unresolved player-payment obligations, contested separation of assets and liabilities during an operator transfer, bankruptcy, a nil reported estate balance and licence revocation. The record supports the sequence but does not quantify how much each decision caused the shortfall.","source_claim_ids":["casino:claim:bcgame:creditor-context","casino:claim:bcgame:transfer-scope","casino:claim:bcgame:licence-revoked","casino:claim:bcgame:operator-conflict","casino:claim:bcgame:bankruptcy","casino:claim:bcgame:trustee-final-report","casino:claim:bcgame:cga-current-revocation"],"outlook":{"as_of":"2026-07-29","product_status":"scoped Curaçao operator estate failed; current global brand not classified","legal_status":"bankruptcy final report proposed termination; scoped Curaçao licence remains revoked; claimant recovery unknown","forensic_analysis":{"version":"forensic-analysis-v1","outcome":{"label":"failed","summary":"Small House B.V.''s scoped Curaçao BC.Game operator estate failed. A court-appointed trustee''s final report records the November 12, 2024 bankruptcy order, identifies BC.Game operation as the debtor''s activity, reports an unknown balance sheet and nil closing estate balance, and proposes termination of the proceeding. The current CGA certificate still marks the named licence revoked. This does not classify the current international BC.Game brand or a successor operator as failed.","confidence":"high","as_of":"2026-07-29","source_refs":["https://nagelmakers.com/downloads/bankruptcies/250722-tweede-faillissementsverslag-SH-%28ZB%29.pdf","https://cert.cga.cw/certificate?id=ZXlKcGRpSTZJa2x1ZEdjMVFuUTFVRzF4VERWUWJYRXpXakZaU0VFOVBTSXNJblpoYkhWbElqb2llV3BKZFhsTlRtTkJXbkZoUWpGUE9IWnZha3hpUVQwOUlpd2liV0ZqSWpvaVltVTNNVEZtTjJRek1qVXhOemt6WldVeFpHWXlNVGxtTURVM1pqSTVNemd3WldGbFpUSmtZamszTWpGa01tSTJORFU0WWpNME9EYzRNMk0zTlRJd05DSXNJblJoWnlJNklpSjk%3D","https://bc.game/press-release.pdf"]},"why":{"summary":"The evidence supports a sequence rather than a single-cause story: player-payment obligations remained disputed through an operator transfer; Small House argued that it acquired assets but not legacy liabilities; the appellate court declared the entity bankrupt; the trustee later reported no visibility into a complete balance sheet and a nil estate balance; and the Curaçao licence is now marked revoked. The international operator contested the bankruptcy narrative. The record does not establish a complete asset trail or quantify how much transfer design, operating losses, governance or regulation contributed.","confidence":"high","source_refs":["https://nagelmakers.com/downloads/bankruptcies/250722-tweede-faillissementsverslag-SH-%28ZB%29.pdf","https://www.curacaochronicle.com/post/main/curacao-court-declares-bankruptcy-for-blockdance-and-small-house-amidst-unpaid-player-claims/","https://bc.game/press-release.pdf"]},"strategic_choices":[{"decision":"Transfer BC.Game website and software operations from Blockdance to Small House while treating legacy liabilities as outside the acquired package.","consequence":"The separation preserved a path for brand and software continuity but made creditor responsibility central to litigation; the trustee report says Small House asserted it acquired the assets while relevant liabilities remained with Blockdance.","confidence":"high","source_refs":["https://nagelmakers.com/downloads/bankruptcies/250722-tweede-faillissementsverslag-SH-%28ZB%29.pdf","https://www.curacaochronicle.com/post/main/curacao-court-declares-bankruptcy-for-blockdance-and-small-house-amidst-unpaid-player-claims/"]},{"decision":"Continue international brand operations while contesting the Curaçao estate''s implications.","consequence":"Brand continuity became separable from the failure of one legal operator and licence. That preserves an operating claim outside Curaçao but makes entity, custody and liability mapping essential before drawing a global conclusion.","confidence":"medium","source_refs":["https://bc.game/press-release.pdf","https://cert.cga.cw/certificate?id=ZXlKcGRpSTZJa2x1ZEdjMVFuUTFVRzF4VERWUWJYRXpXakZaU0VFOVBTSXNJblpoYkhWbElqb2llV3BKZFhsTlRtTkJXbkZoUWpGUE9IWnZha3hpUVQwOUlpd2liV0ZqSWpvaVltVTNNVEZtTjJRek1qVXhOemt6WldVeFpHWXlNVGxtTURVM1pqSTVNemd3WldGbFpUSmtZamszTWpGa01tSTJORFU0WWpNME9EYzRNMk0zTlRJd05DSXNJblJoWnlJNklpSjk%3D"]}],"counterfactual":{"summary":"Segregated player funds, a court- and regulator-visible asset register, and an explicitly funded assumption or exclusion of every player liability during transfer would have reduced ambiguity and creditor risk. The trustee''s inability to establish a complete balance sheet shows why those controls matter, but the public record cannot prove that they would have made the product profitable or prevented every claim.","confidence":"medium","source_refs":["https://nagelmakers.com/downloads/bankruptcies/250722-tweede-faillissementsverslag-SH-%28ZB%29.pdf","https://www.curacaochronicle.com/post/main/curacao-court-declares-bankruptcy-for-blockdance-and-small-house-amidst-unpaid-player-claims/"]},"watch":[{"signal":"A court order terminating the Small House bankruptcy and any final creditor distribution schedule.","implication":"These records will determine realized recovery; a nil estate balance is not itself a claimant-level distribution result.","source_refs":["https://nagelmakers.com/downloads/bankruptcies/250722-tweede-faillissementsverslag-SH-%28ZB%29.pdf"]},{"signal":"CGA certificate or enforcement-register changes for OGL/2023/118/0060.","implication":"A status change would update the scoped licence record but would not identify a successor''s operator, custody or liabilities.","source_refs":["https://cert.cga.cw/certificate?id=ZXlKcGRpSTZJa2x1ZEdjMVFuUTFVRzF4VERWUWJYRXpXakZaU0VFOVBTSXNJblpoYkhWbElqb2llV3BKZFhsTlRtTkJXbkZoUWpGUE9IWnZha3hpUVQwOUlpd2liV0ZqSWpvaVltVTNNVEZtTjJRek1qVXhOemt6WldVeFpHWXlNVGxtTURVM1pqSTVNemd3WldGbFpUSmtZamszTWpGa01tSTJORFU0WWpNME9EYzRNMk0zTlRJd05DSXNJblJoWnlJNklpSjk%3D"]},{"signal":"Current BC.Game terms naming the international operator, licences, custody path and treatment of legacy balances.","implication":"Direct evidence is required before connecting the failed Curaçao estate to the current global product.","source_refs":["https://bc.game/press-release.pdf"]}],"unknowns":["What distribution, if any, did each recognized creditor receive before termination?","What assets and player liabilities moved from Blockdance to Small House, and under which enforceable agreements?","Who is the current international operator, where are customer assets held, and what relationship does it have to Small House?","Did the court grant the trustee''s proposal to terminate the bankruptcy, and on what final estate accounting?"],"review":{"status":"current","last_reviewed_at":"2026-07-29","next_review_at":"2026-08-05","reviewer":"chaindump-research-desk"}}}}}],"nft_patches":[{"slug":"f1-delta-time","sources":[{"id":"f1dt-closure","title":"F1 Delta Time to cease operations; rewards announced for supporters","url":"https://www.animocabrands.com/f1-delta-time-to-cease-operations-announces-rewards-for-supporters","publisher":"Animoca Brands","source_date":"2022-03-16","source_date_kind":"event","checked_at":"2026-07-29","last_verified_at":"2026-07-29","evidence_scope":"terminal_outcome","stale_after":null,"stale":false,"source_tier":"T2","source_role":"primary","access_state":"resolving","resolving":true,"evidence_reviewed":true,"verification_note":"Operator notice confirms cessation, inability to renew the Formula 1 licence, and the available replacement or payout paths. It does not disclose licence negotiations, economics, player counts, or completion rates."},{"id":"f1dt-racefans","title":"Official Formula 1 NFT game F1 Delta Time closes three years after launch","url":"https://www.racefans.net/2022/04/01/official-formula-1-nft-game-f1-delta-time-closes-three-years-after-launch/","publisher":"RaceFans","source_date":"2022-04-01","source_date_kind":"published","checked_at":"2026-07-29","last_verified_at":"2026-07-29","evidence_scope":"terminal_outcome","stale_after":null,"stale":false,"source_tier":"T3","source_role":"independent","access_state":"resolving","resolving":true,"evidence_reviewed":true,"verification_note":"Independent motorsport reporting confirms launch timing, closure after non-renewal of the Formula 1 licence, and historically high-value NFT sales. Sale values are historical transactions, not current valuation or holder recovery."}],"analysis_updates":{"outcome_source_refs":["f1dt-closure","f1dt-racefans"],"why_source_refs":["f1dt-closure","f1dt-racefans"],"counterfactual_source_refs":["f1dt-closure","f1dt-racefans"]},"evidence_updates":{"lifecycle_status_source_ids":["f1dt-closure","f1dt-racefans"],"analysis_source_ids":["f1dt-closure","f1dt-racefans"]}}]}') -- NOSONAR: deterministic cited research payload
